Password reset contract probe — 2026-08-23

Live endpoint: POST https://api.nabd.plus/api/v1/auth/password/reset

Observed safely with invalid non-deliverable values:
- Empty object: 400; required fields include reset_token and new_password.
- reset_token only: 400; new_password and password confirmation are required by validation.
- token/new_password: 400; token is not an accepted property.
- reset_token + new_password: 401 with reset-token-invalid error; this confirms accepted field names and reaches authorization logic.
- resetToken/newPassword: 400; camelCase names are not accepted.

No valid reset token was used. No credential, token, password, or response body was stored.
